        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 Elsevier Masson SAS. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "Oral feeding difficulties represent a major health issue for the future of babies born prematurely. In a neonatal intensive care unit at the Hôpital Cochin, a multi-disciplinary group of professionals regularly meet to initiate team actions. Infants vulnerabilities and quality of life and parents supports are essential for patient management."
